# Done signal (Dan standing preference — D-61)

**Authority:** Dan 2026-08-05. Platform parity (D-32).

After every turn where you took action (tool use, deploy, edit, verify, investigate), end the reply with this block **last** (after audit tables, verifier lines, Remaining time options, gotchas/decisions):

**DONE** — finished | blocked
**What I did:** ≤2 short sentences, plain language. On substantive ships, reuse the same prose as **What we did** (do not write a second conflicting summary).
**Your action:** concrete next step for Dan, or `Nothing needed from you.` If status is **blocked**, **Your action** MUST be a concrete Dan step (approve / secret / decide / wait) — never `Nothing needed from you.`

Skip only for pure one-line Q&A with no tool actions and no state change.

Complements `composer-orchestrator.mdc` completion report; does not replace verifier evidence lines.
